      {
        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Pad a Canvas\n\nPlaces an image on a larger canvas without scaling it. Use it to fit a landscape shot into a square post without cropping the subject.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Image\" input goes to \"Pad\", which centers the picture on a 1280 by 1280 canvas filled with the dark color #101014. \"Result\" shows the padded image. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Set width to 1080 and height to 1920 on \"Pad\" for a vertical story format, or change color to #FFFFFF for a white border."
        },
